Z||000013||DaRkLoRD||09-16-2000||02:45 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by KnightRyder31:<BR><B>Darklord, Sounds good to me. Standerd, I don't have a V6 Fiero, or that would be a good idea.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hmm.. my setup is designed for the V6.. I haven't studied the 4cyl enough to know whether or not the design could be modified.. I have a question about the duke.. I've never worked with a 4cyl Fiero engine before, so I don't know much about them.... here, I'll post a picture which should explain my question.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/duke-question.jpg">  <P>A friend of mine has an Oldsmobile with a 2.8, and it has a similar looking feature which is the air cleaner housing. Is that what this is? If so.. can anyone send me a picture of the 4cyl without this part attached?<P>------------------<BR>   <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>   <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 09-16-2000).]||||reg||5
