Z||000015||2xsess||09-17-2000||04:31 AM||||I read somewhere that the V6 Fiero air intake system was extremely efficient and a hose like Loki posted isn't really worth it. But I wonder. I know that those aftermarket kits are of much better quality. I work with a bunch of guys who've put them on their ricers. They say it did improve the power a little but not much. I just wish that one for our cars was as cheap as theirs (around$100). <P><BR>Darklord, How much do you think your idea would cost to produce?<P><BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||1
